<title>UK: TABLE-Oxford Biomedica posts 9-mth loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Oxford Biomedica posts 9-mth loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to June 30, 1997 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.3 loss	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Operating		  1.397 loss	   vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.253 loss	   vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British gene therapy company is Oxford Biomedica Plc. The company was first listed on the Alternative Investment Market (AIM) at the end of last year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
